WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:02.670
Tutafute ukubwa wa maumbo haya

00:02.670 --> 00:04.370
na kisha kama tuna muda, tunaweza

00:04.370 --> 00:06.520
kutafuta uso wa eneo.

00:06.520 --> 00:08.940
Nitachora mcheduara hapa.

00:08.940 --> 00:11.310
Hapa ni juu ya mche duara.

00:11.310 --> 00:14.910
Huu ni urefu wa mcheduara.

00:14.910 --> 00:16.710
Hiki ni kitako hapa.

00:16.710 --> 00:18.250
Kama hii ingekuwa inaonesha, labda

00:18.250 --> 00:20.960
ungeona upande wa nyuma ya mcheduara huu.

00:20.960 --> 00:23.490
Unaweza chukulia kama chupa ya soda.

00:23.490 --> 00:30.220
Tuseme urefu wa mcheduara ni 8.

00:30.220 --> 00:31.450
Nitaipa kizio.

00:31.450 --> 00:34.750
Sentimita 8, huu ni urefu wangu.

00:34.750 --> 00:37.370
Na tuchukulie kipenyo

00:37.370 --> 00:40.930
juu ya mcheduara wa soda yangu ni

00:40.930 --> 00:45.030
sentimita 4.

00:45.030 --> 00:47.620
Je ukubwa utakuwa nini?

00:47.620 --> 00:51.100
Ujazo utakuwa nini?

00:51.100 --> 00:54.046
Na wazo hapa ni lile lile

00:54.046 --> 00:55.920
ambalo tumeliona kwenye swali lililopita.

00:55.920 --> 00:58.550
Ukitafuta uso wa eneo la upande mmoja

00:58.550 --> 01:00.860
na kisha tafuta kima chake,

01:00.860 --> 01:02.630
utaweza kujua ujazo.

01:02.630 --> 01:04.463
Kitu cha kwanza tunakwenda kufanya hapa ni kutafuta

01:04.463 --> 01:08.120
eneo la uso wa mche duara,

01:08.120 --> 01:10.510
au juu ya kopo la soda.

01:10.510 --> 01:12.720
Na kisha tunazidisha na urefu wake.

01:12.720 --> 01:13.970
Na hiyo itatupa ujazo.

01:13.970 --> 01:15.594
Hii itatuambia, ni

01:15.594 --> 01:17.640
sentimita ngapi za mraba zinatosha hapo juu.

01:17.640 --> 01:20.950
Na kisha kama tukizidisha na sentimita

01:20.950 --> 01:23.190
tunashuka chini, na kisha itatupa

01:23.190 --> 01:27.790
ukubwa wa sentimita za mcheduara huu.

01:27.790 --> 01:30.477
Tunatafutaje hili eneo hapa juu?

01:30.477 --> 01:32.060
Eneo la hapa juu ni

01:32.060 --> 01:33.570
tunatafuta eneo la duara.

01:33.570 --> 01:36.820
Unaweza chora kama hivi.

01:36.820 --> 01:38.570
Kama tukiangalia moja kwa moja kwenye,

01:38.570 --> 01:42.460
hili duara lenye nusu kipenyo cha sentimita 4.

01:42.460 --> 01:45.810
Eneo la duara lenye kipenyo cha sentimita 4

01:45.810 --> 01:48.070
ni sawa na pai r kipeo cha pili.

01:48.070 --> 01:51.580
Hivyo itakuwa π r2,

01:51.580 --> 01:55.940
mara sentimita 4, ambayo ni sawa na 4,

01:55.940 --> 01:58.970
ni 16, mara pai.

01:58.970 --> 02:03.690
Na kizio chetu kitakuwa sm 2.

02:03.690 --> 02:06.390
Au njia nyingine hizi ni sentimita za mraba.

02:06.390 --> 02:07.630
Hilo ndio eneo.

02:07.630 --> 02:11.460
Hivyo ukubwa utakuwa eneo hili hapa mara urefu.

02:11.460 --> 02:16.480
Hivyo ukubwa utakuwa ni sawa na 16 pai

02:16.480 --> 02:24.486
sentimita za mraba mara urefu mara sentimita 8.

02:29.900 --> 02:32.540
Na hivyo unapozidisha,

02:32.540 --> 02:34.420
zile zinazofanana, unaweza

02:34.420 --> 02:36.700
kuzipanga na kuzisogeza.

02:36.700 --> 02:38.716
Haijalishi utatumia mpangilio gani

02:38.716 --> 02:39.840
kama zote ni kuzidisha.

02:39.840 --> 02:42.690
Hivyo hii ni sawa na 16 mara 8.

02:42.690 --> 02:43.190
Tuangalie

02:43.190 --> 02:44.400
8 mara 8 ni 64.

02:44.400 --> 02:45.860
16 mara 8 ni mara mbili ya hiyo.

02:45.860 --> 02:50.360
Itakuwa pai 128.

02:50.360 --> 02:53.060
Sasa unaweza ukawa na sm 2 mara sm.

02:53.060 --> 02:56.430
Hii itatupa sentimita za ukubwa/sm3.

02:56.430 --> 02:59.130
Au sentimita za ukubwa pai 128.

02:59.130 --> 03:01.220
Kumbuka pai ni namba.

03:01.220 --> 03:03.130
Tunaiandika kama pai, kwa sababu

03:03.130 --> 03:06.770
ni kitu kama ukikiandika

03:06.770 --> 03:08.490
huwezi kumaliza kuandika pai.

03:08.490 --> 03:13.010
3.141559 nakuendelea, haijirudii.

03:13.010 --> 03:14.550
Hivyo tunaiacha kama pai.

03:14.550 --> 03:17.091
Lakini kama ukitaka kuitafuta, unaweza tumia kikokotoleo.

03:17.091 --> 03:20.020
Na hii kwa haraka haraka itakuwa 3.14 , mara 128.

03:20.020 --> 03:25.230
Hivyo itakaribia sm3 400.

03:25.230 --> 03:28.390
Sasa, tunatafutaje eneo la mbele?

03:28.390 --> 03:32.350
Tunatafutaje eneo uso wa umbo hili?

03:32.350 --> 03:34.890
Sehemu ya eneo uso wa umbo hili ni juu

03:34.890 --> 03:35.540
na chini.

03:35.540 --> 03:39.430
Hivyo hii ni sehemu ya uso wa umbo.

03:39.430 --> 03:41.600
Na kisha eneo la chini la umbo hili pia

03:41.600 --> 03:44.650
ni sehemu ya uso.

03:44.650 --> 03:51.490
Hivyo kama tunatafuta eneo la uso,

03:51.490 --> 03:54.520
tutakuwa na sehemu zote mbili hapa juu na chini.

03:54.520 --> 03:57.990
Hivyo itakuwa na sentimita za mraba 16 pai.

03:57.990 --> 03:59.470
Hii ni pai 16.

03:59.470 --> 04:01.920
Hii ni pai sentimita za mraba 16.

04:01.920 --> 04:06.670
Itakuwa 2 mara pai sentimita za mraba 16.

04:06.670 --> 04:08.520
Nitaendelea kutumia kizio.

04:08.520 --> 04:11.432
Hivyo hii inakamilisha juu na chini.

04:11.432 --> 04:13.140
Na kisha tunatafuta eneo

04:13.140 --> 04:15.050
la mche.

04:15.050 --> 04:16.820
Na ninavyofikiria

04:16.820 --> 04:19.170
kama unajaribu kuizungusha na karatasi.

04:19.170 --> 04:22.019
Nitachora vinukta vidogo hapa.

04:22.019 --> 04:24.130
Fikiria kama utaikata hivi.

04:24.130 --> 04:25.730
Kata upande wa kopo la soda.

04:25.730 --> 04:30.540
Na kama ukilifungua kwa

04:30.540 --> 04:32.830
kulizunguka, utapata nini.

04:32.830 --> 04:34.890
Utapata kitu.

04:34.890 --> 04:36.850
Utabakiwa na karatasi

04:36.850 --> 04:40.170
ambapo urefu huu hapa

04:40.170 --> 04:42.560
ni sawa na urefu huu hapa.

04:42.560 --> 04:45.430
Na itakuwa hazijashikana tena.

04:45.430 --> 04:47.710
Na kisha hizi mbili zinaisha --nitatumia

04:47.710 --> 04:52.040
rangi ya majenta--hizi mbili zinaisha kwa zenyewe.

04:52.040 --> 04:54.680
Na --nitatumia rangi ambayo bado sijaitumia,

04:54.680 --> 04:57.380
Niatatumia rangi ya pinki--hizi mbili zinaisha

04:57.380 --> 04:59.940
kwa zenyewe.

04:59.940 --> 05:02.780
Na huwa zinashikana zenyewe hapa.

05:02.780 --> 05:05.100
Hivyo urefu wa upande huu na huu

05:05.100 --> 05:09.320
utakuwa kitu kile kile kama urefu wa mcheduara.

05:09.320 --> 05:11.660
Itakuwa sentimita 8.

05:11.660 --> 05:14.850
Na kisha hii hapa itakuwa pia sentimita 8.

05:14.850 --> 05:16.290
Na swali la kujiuliza

05:16.290 --> 05:21.430
wenyewe ni kipenyo kitakuwa nini

05:21.430 --> 05:23.027
hapa.

05:23.027 --> 05:24.860
Kumbuka, kipenyo maana yake

05:24.860 --> 05:28.382
ni kwa kiasi gani tumezunguka mche.

05:28.382 --> 05:29.840
Ukitazama, itakuwa

05:29.840 --> 05:32.980
ni sawa na mzingo nusu duara

05:32.980 --> 05:36.240
wa mcheduara.

05:36.240 --> 05:37.950
Mzingo wa duara ni nini?

05:37.950 --> 05:39.689
Mzingo wa duara hili ni

05:39.689 --> 05:41.980
huu hapa, ambao ni sawa na

05:41.980 --> 05:47.110
duara hili hapa, ni 2 mara kipenyo mara pai.

05:47.110 --> 05:49.890
Au pai 2 mara kipenyo.

05:49.890 --> 05:57.460
Pai 2 mara sentimita 4 ambayo ni sawa na sentimita pai 8.

05:57.460 --> 06:00.230
Hivyo umbali huu hapa ndio mzingo

06:00.230 --> 06:02.780
wa chini wa mche duara.

06:02.780 --> 06:06.440
Itakuwa sentimita 8 pai.

06:06.440 --> 06:07.890
Hivyo kama unatafuta uso wa

06:07.890 --> 06:09.780
eneo lililozungushiwi, sehemu tu

06:09.780 --> 06:13.380
inayozunguka mcheduara,sio chini wala juu,

06:13.380 --> 06:16.580
unapoifungua ukainyoosha inaonekana kama mstatili.

06:16.580 --> 06:19.790
Na eneo lake , eneo la hiyo sehemu tu,

06:19.790 --> 06:22.300
itakuwa ni sawa na sentimita 8 mara pai 8

06:22.300 --> 06:23.389
sentimita.

06:23.389 --> 06:24.430
Ngoja niifanye hivi.

06:24.430 --> 06:31.880
Itakuwa sentimita 8 mara pai 8 sentimita.

06:31.880 --> 06:35.190
Na hiyo ni sawa na pai 64.

06:35.190 --> 06:36.260
8 mara 8 ni 64.

06:36.260 --> 06:40.472
Una sentimita za mraba pai.

06:40.472 --> 06:42.680
Hivyo unavyotaka eneo la uso mzima,

06:42.680 --> 06:44.610
una juu na chini,

06:44.610 --> 06:45.950
tumeshaziona huko.

06:45.950 --> 06:47.510
Na kisha unataka kutafuta eneo la umbo linalozunguka.

06:47.510 --> 06:48.551
Tumeshaona.

06:48.551 --> 06:54.470
Hivyo itakuwa jumlisha pai sentimita za mraba .64

06:54.470 --> 06:56.770
Na sasa tunakokotoa.

06:56.770 --> 07:02.580
Hivyo inatupa 2 mara 16, itakuwa sawa na 32.

07:02.580 --> 07:09.480
Hii ni pai 32 sentimita za mraba, jumlisha pai 64.

07:09.480 --> 07:12.400
Nitashuka upande wa kulia kidogo.

07:12.400 --> 07:15.240
Jumlisha pai sentimita za mraba 64.

07:15.240 --> 07:23.330
Na kisha 32 jumlisha 64 ni pai sentimita za mraba 96.

07:23.330 --> 07:26.760
Hivyo ni sawa na pai sentimita za mraba 96 ambayo

07:26.760 --> 07:30.830
itakuwa zaidi kidogo zaidi ya sentimita za mraba 300.

07:30.830 --> 07:32.890
Na kumbuka, tunapotafuta eneo la uso

07:32.890 --> 07:35.920
tunapata jibu letu kwenye sentimita za mraba.

07:35.920 --> 07:38.610
Hii inaleta maana, kwa sababu,eneo la uso ni

07:38.610 --> 07:40.430
vipimo vya pande mbili.

07:40.430 --> 07:42.550
Fikiria sentimita ngapi za mraba zinaweza

07:42.550 --> 07:45.080
tosha kwenye uso wa mcheduara.

07:45.080 --> 07:48.680
Tunapotafuta ukubwa tunapata sm3,

07:48.680 --> 07:49.907
au sentimita za ukubwa.

07:49.907 --> 07:51.740
Na hii ni kwa sababu, tunajaribu kukokotoa

07:51.740 --> 07:58.170
ni moja ngapi kwa sentimita moja, kwa moja

07:58.170 --> 08:01.010
za ukubwa zinatosha ndani ya umbo hili.

08:01.010 --> 08:03.210
Na hii ndio maana ni sentimita za ukubwa.

08:03.210 --> 08:07.180
Naamini imefananua kitu.
